  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Based Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vulnerable refugees, asylum seekers, and migrants in Costa Rica especially women and girls, can live free from violence, support basic needs and incomes, and access legal status that allows them to live in dignity through community based protection</narrative>
